{"kind": "mod", "id": 845, "name": "Arse Scratching Service (ASS)", "slug": "arse-scratching-service-ass", "teaser": "On a long raid and your armor melted?  Weapon dying?  Faceshield riddled?  Arse Scratching Service can fix this.  Perfect for long raids where you realize nobody loves you.", "owner_name": "Props", "downloads": 12515, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/1138.png", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:46.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-04-14T17:49:19.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-04-14T17:49:19.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "1.7.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>This mod will gradually repair your armor overtime after a set amount of time that you were last hit (configurable from bepinex menu f12).</p>\n<p>The rate at which it repairs the armor is also configurable. Not to make this too cheap, i have set the repair rate pretty low and you need at least 60 seconds before it begins repairing the armor.</p>\n<p>There is one false flag from virustotal. If you guys are scared you can can recompile the code from my github.</p>\n<p>It will only repair items with an armorcomponent in the following slots:</p>\n<p>headwear, facecover, armorvest, tacticalvest, eyewear</p>\n<p><strong>Installation.</strong></p>\n<p>Drop the dll into your /bepinex/plugins folder.</p>\n<p><strong>Removal</strong></p>\n<p>Remove from the installation folder and thats it.</p>\n<p>If you guys enjoy my work and feel like buying me caffeine, here’s my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/T6T7QSN01\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">kofi.</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.5.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1619,